scripts.text:
{0}
The Magic Tournament is going to start soon.
Enter the portal to the south and you can join in.

scripts.translation:
{0}
魔法大賽即將開始。
進入南邊的傳送門就能參賽。

scripts.text:
{0}
Give me your name so I can write it down.
You will automatically be registered for the tournament now.

scripts.translation:
{0}
請告訴我您的名字，我來登記。
登記後就算正式報名參賽了。

scripts.text:
{0}
The Magic Tournament is going to start soon.
Enter the portal to the south and you can join in.

scripts.translation:
{0}
魔法大賽即將開始。
進入南邊的傳送門就能參賽。

scripts.text:
{0}
Thank you for visiting the Geffen Magic Tournament.
What can I do for you?

scripts.translation:
{0}
感謝您光臨吉芬魔法大賽。
請問有什麼可以幫您？

scripts.text:
{0}
This festival used to be a more studious event with scholars discussing magical methods.
Now it's all about fun and a big party.

scripts.translation:
{0}
這個慶典過去更偏重學術，學者們會聚在一起探討魔法技法。
如今倒成了一場熱鬧的大聚會。

scripts.text:
{0}
Now it has become almost exclusively a fighting tournament.
The most famous Mages from all over the world come for the tournament.

scripts.translation:
{0}
現在，它幾乎完全變成了格鬥比賽。
世界各地最有名的魔法師都會來參賽。

scripts.text:
{0}
There is no registration fee to enter.
The only requirement is to pass a simple test.

{0}
If you fail you will automatically be eliminated from the list but you can try again as many times as you wish.
Do you want to take the test?

scripts.translation:
{0}
失敗後，您會自動從名單中除名，但可以不限次數地重試。
要參加測試嗎？

scripts.text:
{0}
You can participate in the Magic Tournament after passing the test.
Then, let us begin!

scripts.translation:
{0}
通過測試就能參加魔法大賽。
那麼，開始吧！

{0}
女士們，先生們！
歡迎來到吉芬魔法大賽！

{0}
今年的比賽分為A、B兩組。
兩組的優勝者將在決賽中一決高下，爭奪冠軍。

{0}
我是A組的主持人，吉芬學院大師~！
大魔導師贊扎巴爾·赫爾莫德！

scripts.text:
{0}
I am honored to be this year's MC.
Now, it's time for the matches to begin.

scripts.translation:
{0}
很榮幸能擔任今年的主持人。
現在，比賽即將開始。

scripts.text:
{0}
You won the competition!
Congratulations!

scripts.translation:
{0}
您贏得了比賽！
恭喜！

scripts.text:
{0}
By the way, the Academy Master has
something to tell you!

scripts.translation:
{0}
恭喜！
這屆選手的實力，是歷屆大賽中最強的。

scripts.text:
{0}
I present to you your earned ^55CC55Geffen
Magic Tournament Coins.^000000

{0}
Your name will be remembered in the
history books of Geffen.

scripts.translation:
{0}
再次恭喜您。
希望您接下來也能盡情享受吉芬的慶典。

{0}
恭喜！您擊敗了A組的所有對手！
祝您在決賽中好運！

scripts.text:
{0}
Need more time to prepare I see.
Not a problem, talk to me when you're ready.

scripts.translation:
{0}
看來您還需要更多時間準備。
沒關係，準備好後再來找我。

scripts.text:
{0}
Let's take a rain check on our match.
We'll fight next time we meet...

scripts.translation:
{0}
我們的比賽改日再約吧。
下次見面時再一決高下...

scripts.text:
{0}
That was a good match~!
Not bad at all~!

scripts.translation:
{0}
這是一場精彩的比賽~！
表現相當不錯~！

scripts.text:
{0}
You have been very impressive today.
I want to give you a present~!

scripts.translation:
{0}
你今天的表現真讓人印象深刻。
我想送你一份禮物~！

scripts.text:
{0}
It was a good game.
Hope you get farther next time.

scripts.translation:
{0}
打得不錯。
希望下次你能晉級到更後面的輪次。

scripts.text:
{0}
Take this gift.
Keep trying harder~!

scripts.translation:
{0}
收下這份禮物。
繼續加油~！
